### ============================================================
### 알림 시스템 APIs
### ============================================================

### ----------------------------------------------------------
### 알림 목록 조회 (페이징)
### ----------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------------
### 읽지 않은 알림 조회
### ----------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/unread
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------------
### 알림 요약 (읽지 않은 개수)
### ----------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------------
### 알림 읽음 처리
### ----------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/1/read
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------------
### 모든 알림 읽음 처리
### ----------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/read-all
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------------
### 알림 삭제
### ----------------------------------------------------------
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------------
### 알림 설정 조회
### ----------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------------
### 알림 설정 수정
### ----------------------------------------------------------
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "pushEnabled": true,
  "emailEnabled": false,
  "missionNotification": true,
  "guildNotification": true,
  "friendNotification": true,
  "achievementNotification": true
}

### ==========================================================
### [Internal] 어드민 푸시 캠페인 (LUT-508) — admin-service 패스스루 대상
### 로컬은 internal api key 미설정(fail-open)이라 X-Internal-Api-Key 헤더 불필요
### ==========================================================

### 푸시 발송 요청 — 전체 활성 유저
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/internal/push-campaigns
X-Admin-Id: 1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "점검 안내",
  "body": "9/22 02:00~03:00 서버 점검이 있습니다.",
  "action_url": null,
  "target_type": "ALL"
}

### 푸시 발송 요청 — 일부 유저
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/internal/push-campaigns
X-Admin-Id: 1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "이벤트 안내",
  "body": "오늘만 다이아 2배!",
  "action_url": "/shop",
  "target_type": "USERS",
  "user_ids": ["test-user-id", "test-user-id-2"]
}

### 발송 이력 목록 (최신순)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/internal/push-campaigns?page=0&size=20
Accept: application/json

### 발송 이력 상세 (USERS 캠페인은 target_user_ids 포함)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/internal/push-campaigns/1
Accept: application/json
